Retrying instantly can hammer the server. Use `retryWhen` with a delay:

```typescript
import { retryWhen, delay, take } from 'rxjs/operators';

this.http.get('/api/data').pipe(
  retryWhen(errors => errors.pipe(
    delay(1000),
    take(3)
  ))
);
```
This waits 1 second between retries, up to 3 attempts.
